   {
    "h": "Geographic range and habitat",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
     "V. boehmei is native to the forests of Waigeo, Indonesia."
    ]
   },
   {
    "h": "Behavior",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
     "The golden-spotted tree monitor has a prehensile tail, and it spends most of its life in trees."
    ]
